# About

Shiny app for the Australian Aquaculture Infrastructure dataset.

**Reads:** `output_data/summaries/AU_aquaculture_clean.gpkg`

- Layer `leases` drives all counts, filters, charts and tables
  (one row per lease, so `nrow()` is a true lease count).
- Layer `detections` is used only to overlay satellite-detected marine
  infrastructure on the map.

# Packages

```{r, eval=FALSE}
install.packages(c("shiny","bslib","bsicons","sf","dplyr","leaflet",
                   "leaflet.extras","plotly","DT","here","scales","stringr"))
```

